<section class="section section-dim" id="work">
  <div class="wrap work-wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our work</span>
      <h2>We're a new studio — and taking on founding clients.</h2>
      <p>
        We'd rather be upfront than fake a portfolio: this is a new venture,
        so there are no case studies here yet. What you get instead is full
        attention, founder pricing, and a real say in how the studio's first
        projects turn out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="founding-card">
      <h3>Founding client offer</h3>
      <p>
        The first businesses we work with help shape what we build — in
        exchange, you get priority turnaround and a discounted rate on your
        first project. Once we've launched a handful of sites, they'll live
        right here as real case studies.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Become a founding client</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-dim {
    background: var(--paper-dim);
  }

  .founding-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .founding-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .founding-card p {
    color: rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.75);
  }
</style>
